{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_9000_place", "source_sha256": "9da5ea1e5639ad2d1d415e43df10c0664928ed4ff4fcc90c5509c62b7467dfe9", "ja": "夜の繁華街", "zh": "夜间繁华街", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_9001_p", "source_sha256": "e0aca537ec6e9440f251e83197018419d19ed6e507e19749050b3e953220e6bb", "ja": "（今日はアイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア\n撮影。美希のテーマは『地元系ギャル』だ）", "zh": "（今天是偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真拍摄。美希的主题是“本地系辣妹”）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_9002_003mik", "source_sha256": "524cd17c3d14572190f28b8b0ef463c9c7baf3b02b7ff35d15ce8c7fbee398af", "ja": "ミキ、このスカジャン気に入ったの。\n背中の模様も、なんていうか……カッコイイね♪", "zh": "美希很喜欢这件横须贺夹克。\n背后的图案也怎么说呢……很帅气♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_9003_p", "source_sha256": "f2901e8d8856b0ffdb3f6c862c797d8f54f830b62c7253ef1fe01d1ddc55e79c", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。それにしても、さすが美希だ。\nカッコいい衣装も、バッチリ着こなしてるし。", "zh": "嗯，确实。不过话说回来，真不愧是美希，连这么帅气的服装都能完美驾驭。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_9004_003mik", "source_sha256": "95a832e3b4d58d279a82e9cd40ef6dbe6d49e156b62907d6ce3b26f6fd2e0b2c", "ja": "でも、『地元系ギャル』ってテーマで撮るんだよね。\nふつうのギャルと何が違うの？", "zh": "不过，是要以“本地辣妹”为主题拍摄吧。\n和普通辣妹有什么不同？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_9005_003mik", "source_sha256": "55850a694df678901e2aed8675ec72974daf4273aa8520e7fa8c01ca4b0f2482", "ja": "だから、教えてほしいな。\n{$P$}は、どんなミキを想像したの？", "zh": "所以，告诉我嘛。\n{$P$}想象中的美希是什么样的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_9006_p", "source_sha256": "38acac05722f15c7b21f9db62a35c993f44d2423bf309cac33e19bb227b78ca2", "ja": "えっ？　それは……。", "zh": "咦？那个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_9007", "source_sha256": "ad00b0fffb7a5edb2a982b5857de5745e21e8b0c63583ce89590b0deee686604", "ja": "ちょっと怖そう", "zh": "看起来有点可怕", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_9008", "source_sha256": "01bd857357e02b7f0f55334010ae7abe787a31b4c948736fa9bc3cbc70fc5b05", "ja": "気さくな感じ", "zh": "随和的感觉", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_9200_p", "source_sha256": "2acffee840b43751d0ac1987c9849e4a394f747fd80ab5cc5a3d2fe69ab4649e", "ja": "ちょいワルな感じだな。地元の同級生にいたら、\n目をそらしてしまうような感じの……。", "zh": "感觉有点坏坏的啊。要是老家同学里有这种人，\n感觉会让人忍不住移开视线的那种……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_9201_003mik", "source_sha256": "0909ee0b0fedfb090aa955129a939874d3e3418399f37d7e373c3db46b519430", "ja": "え～！？　{$P$}はミキのこと\nちゃんと見ててくれなきゃ、ヤなの！", "zh": "欸～！？{$P$}可得好好看着美希才行，不然美希不要！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_9202_003mik", "source_sha256": "39a418d2534dc41c06aa350c6ebda799cd83d8059f79d3c761c2b17f492c4e06", "ja": "むー……。こうなったら、怖くても目が離せない！って\nくらい、ちょいワルなミキに夢中にさせるの！", "zh": "唔……既然这样，我就要让你迷上有点坏坏的美希，迷到就算害怕也完全移不开视线的程度！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_9300_p", "source_sha256": "2acffee840b43751d0ac1987c9849e4a394f747fd80ab5cc5a3d2fe69ab4649e", "ja": "ちょいワルな感じだな。地元の同級生にいたら、\n目をそらしてしまうような感じの……。", "zh": "感觉有点坏坏的啊。要是老家同学里有这种人，\n感觉会让人忍不住移开视线的那种……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_9301_003mik", "source_sha256": "e8a3858dc14807470793df7f185e2f489381888922d882e2184165c0e8cacb0d", "ja": "ふーん、{$P$}は\n今のミキから目をそらしちゃうんだ？", "zh": "哦——，{$P$}会把视线从现在的美希身上移开吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_9302_003mik", "source_sha256": "fcc7e18c3e06740462a3e40ca0f7b11de0afe6cf20daea824a94aa13a8a41157", "ja": "ミキ、なんだかやる気なくなっちゃった。\nあふぅ……。", "zh": "美希，不知怎么的突然没干劲了。\n啊呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_9500_p", "source_sha256": "b7609dfb70bff4bfba2e3a38b032d1642e7a29b0c286791850b1deff6933ab79", "ja": "どんな人にも分け隔てなく接していて、気軽に話して\nくれる感じかな。地元でも頼れる存在みたいな！", "zh": "对谁都一视同仁、平易近人，\n很有那种在老家也值得依靠的感觉吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_9501_003mik", "source_sha256": "f4df4d1cacc9bbe8edcd699eae84c819a105599cb7478d8d97aac44a7297480b", "ja": "わあ……なんだか『地元系ギャル』っぽいの！\nそっかー。そういう方向でやればいいんだね♪", "zh": "哇……感觉有点像“本地辣妹”呢！\n原来如此～按这个方向来演就好对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_9502_003mik", "source_sha256": "17cee719857ff59749f3cee9cd8377439108338d3711c358fb04ba6def957edb", "ja": "「この辺の案内はミキにお任せなの！　だからキミも\n一緒に遊んじゃおっ♪」って、感じでどうかな？", "zh": "“这一带的向导就包在美希身上吧！所以你也\n一起来玩嘛♪”这种感觉怎么样呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_9600_p", "source_sha256": "b7609dfb70bff4bfba2e3a38b032d1642e7a29b0c286791850b1deff6933ab79", "ja": "どんな人にも分け隔てなく接していて、気軽に話して\nくれる感じかな。地元でも頼れる存在みたいな！", "zh": "对谁都一视同仁、平易近人，\n很有那种在老家也值得依靠的感觉吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_9601_003mik", "source_sha256": "1c1401483116a90d056963e1a4e6b7c62d3c219aef44934977a109ef08488021", "ja": "うーん……ミキのイメージとは、ちょっと違うの。\nミキ的には、怖さもあった方がいいって思うな。", "zh": "嗯……和美希印象中的形象，有点不一样。\n在美希看来，还是带点威严比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_003mik_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_003mik_9602_003mik", "source_sha256": "f84c6ad994f9d01e202bbc42bd3ef0763f21e866e085099e8d596ed68ead7efb", "ja": "……{$P$}、なんかいろんな人に\n騙されちゃいそうだよね。ミキ、ちょっと心配……。", "zh": "……{$P$}总觉得很容易被各种各样的人\n骗呢。美希，有点担心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
